-- 46. DESCRIPT
-- ============================================================
UPDATE tools SET
  name        = $d46$Descript$d46$,
  url         = $d46$https://descript.com$d46$,
  domain      = $d46$descript.com$d46$,
  badge       = $d46$freemium$d46$,
  best_for    = $d46$AI video editing, voice cloning, dubbing, MCP automation$d46$,
  description = $d46$Descript's Underlord AI now uses reasoning models for complex edits, with video generation via Veo 3.1 and Sora 2. Dubbing expanded to 45 languages with lip sync and 21 new stock voices.$d46$,
  description_long = $dl46$Descript is an AI-powered video and podcast editing platform that treats audio and video like a text document. Users edit media by editing a transcript — cutting words deletes the corresponding footage — and Underlord, Descript's built-in AI layer, handles complex production tasks automatically. It is used by podcasters, video creators, marketers, and production teams.

Underlord now runs on reasoning models, including selectable Gemini 3, enabling it to handle multi-step edit instructions that previously required manual execution. Users can describe complex sequences — cut all pauses over one second, remove filler words, add a chapter break before each topic shift — and Underlord executes them as a coordinated chain rather than a series of individual actions.

Video generation from text prompts is now available via integrated Veo 3.1 and Sora 2, allowing creators to generate B-roll or scene footage directly within Descript without switching to an external tool. Lip sync for dubbed and translated video was added alongside the generation features, improving realism for multilingual content.

Caption translation and dubbing expanded significantly: 39 additional languages are now supported for captions, and 6 new languages gained full dubbing support including voice synthesis. Descript also added 21 new stock voices for AI voiceover, bringing the total library to over 1,000.

MCP (Model Context Protocol) integration allows Claude, and other AI agents that support MCP, to control Descript via natural language prompts. This enables automated editing workflows where an external agent can issue editing commands, run exports, or manage projects programmatically.

Descript is best for video and podcast creators who want AI-assisted editing at the transcript level, and for teams producing multilingual or dubbed content who need integrated lip sync and voice synthesis.$dl46$,
  pros = ARRAY[
    'Underlord on reasoning models handles multi-step complex edits as a single instruction',
    'Veo 3.1 and Sora 2 integration for text-to-video B-roll without leaving the app',
    'Dubbing with lip sync now covers 45 languages — one of the broadest ranges available',
    'MCP integration: Claude and other agents can control Descript programmatically',
    '21 new stock voices added; 1,000+ total for AI voiceover'
  ],
  cons = ARRAY[
    'Reasoning model edits can be slower than manual execution for simple, single-step tasks',
    'Video generation credits are separate from core subscription and can add cost',
    'Lip sync quality varies by language — best results on the 6 fully supported dubbing languages',
    'MCP integration requires technical setup; not accessible to non-developer users'
  ]
WHERE slug = $d46$descript$d46$ AND lang = $d46$en$d46$;

-- ============================================================
-- 47. GAMMA
-- ============================================================
UPDATE tools SET
  name        = $d47$Gamma$d47$,
  url         = $d47$https://gamma.app$d47$,
  domain      = $d47$gamma.app$d47$,
  badge       = $d47$freemium$d47$,
  best_for    = $d47$AI presentations, marketing assets, infographics, programmatic content$d47$,
  description = $d47$Gamma launched a GA Generate API for programmatic content creation and Gamma Imagine for AI marketing graphics. SOC 2 Type II certified. Free plan includes 400 credits; paid plans from $8/mo annual.$d47$,
  description_long = $dl47$Gamma is an AI presentation and document creation platform that generates structured slides, documents, and web pages from text prompts. It is used by marketers, founders, educators, and consultants who need professionally designed visual content without slide-by-slide manual formatting. Gamma handles layout, design, and image placement automatically from the initial prompt.

The Generate API reached general availability in January 2026, enabling programmatic content creation at scale. Developers and marketing platforms can now call the Gamma API to generate presentations, documents, or pages automatically — for example, generating a customized deck for each sales prospect or producing a report template for each client without human intervention per output.

Gamma Imagine, launched in March 2026, is a new standalone AI image generation product targeting marketing asset creation. It produces charts, infographics, social graphics, and promotional visuals directly within the Gamma platform. This positions Gamma as a direct competitor to Canva's AI image features, with a particular focus on data visualization and structured marketing graphics rather than freeform artistic generation.

A new Ultra tier was introduced alongside Gamma Imagine, offering higher generation limits, priority processing, and access to the image generation capabilities. The platform achieved SOC 2 Type II certification, making it suitable for enterprise teams with compliance requirements around data security and vendor trust.

Pricing in 2026: Free plan at 400 credits, Plus at $8/month annual, Pro at $15/month annual, and Ultra at custom or higher-tier pricing. The free tier is generous for individual users who need occasional decks.

Gamma is best for marketers, salespeople, and founders who need AI-generated presentations and marketing graphics quickly, and for development teams that want to automate presentation generation via API.$dl47$,
  pros = ARRAY[
    'Generate API now GA — programmatic content creation at scale for any platform',
    'Gamma Imagine: AI image generation for charts, infographics, and social graphics built in',
    'SOC 2 Type II certified — suitable for enterprise teams with compliance requirements',
    'Free tier includes 400 credits — sufficient for occasional individual use',
    'Handles layout and design automatically — no slide-by-slide formatting required'
  ],
  cons = ARRAY[
    'Ultra tier pricing not publicly disclosed — requires inquiry for enterprise plans',
    'Gamma Imagine image quality is optimized for structured graphics, not artistic generation',
    'API access requires developer setup — not self-serve for non-technical users',
    'Free plan credits are consumed quickly when generating multiple full presentations'
  ]
WHERE slug = $d47$gamma$d47$ AND lang = $d47$en$d47$;

